  _key: npc.hank
  _displayName: Hank
  _description: Warms his hands at the Plains campfire and knows every rabbit by name.
  Role: Old-timer
  Greetings:
  - Sit a spell. The fire's free.
  - Rabbits run in circles. Wait, and they come back round.
  - Back in my day we hunted with a stick and a prayer.
  Idle: Crouch and they can't see you half as far. Old trick.
